<!-- Portion chassis (modules/section-portions): $:/tags/hypergsd/Review members render grouped by their Portion/<n> tag, numbers only (no Top/Full bands on this surface; untagged members land in Portion/1; Portion/9 ships deliberately so later additions can take 6-8 without renumbering). Within-portion order = the engine's sortByList: the tag list's list field first, then member list-before/list-after pins, then engine order. Entries ship in whichever plugin owns them, so an absent sub-plugin is a missing member; a portion whose members are all absent never exists, an all-hidden one renders an empty div that collapses via :empty. Hidden entries ($:/config/hypergsd/Review/visibility/<title> = hide, written by the Settings → Sidebar tab) are gated per entry. No refresh gate: sidebar chrome refreshes natively. -->
